Z||000004||cadaver||05-31-2001||10:00 PM||||Both locks were $22 with matching keys. Yes they were for a fiero. I havent done the trunk lock as the power release still works. But those are not a problem to do.<BR>I dont have small hands I am just to working in tight places as I work alot on planes. The trick is to remove that plastic standoff thing that is infront of the lock clip.||||reg||1
